9,"Aztlan Affirmed, Part VI: Uto-Aztecan Homeland?",https://readmedium.com/aztlan-affirmed-part-vi-uto-aztecan-homeland-2a3d84149412,"Southern Uto-Aztecans lived in what is now Northwest Mexico. Over the next couple of millennia, those groups spread out, their language splitting and evolving into new families. The southern branch gave rise to Tepiman, Tarahumaran, Cahita, Opatan, Corachol.","Nahuatl, Sierra Negra",Uto-Aztecan
